The audit has already identified the rows that need attention. After practicing the preview workflow, this project begins when corrections are approved.

You will carry one two-file workspace through five milestones:

1. correct one item;
2. update an approved group;
3. delete one confirmed test item;
4. delete a second row only while its safety conditions still hold;
5. produce the final inventory handoff.

`operations.sql` accumulates the approved `UPDATE` and `DELETE` statements. `query.sql` changes at each milestone to verify the current result.
